तेषां निष्ठा तु का कृष्ण सत्त्वमाहो रजस्तम: ॥ १ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4269,\"bb\":3753,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/1/b3753/\",\"body_value\":\"arjuna uvāca
