दम्भाहङ्कारसंयुक्ता: कामरागबलान्विता: ॥ ५ ॥
कर्षयन्त: शरीरस्थं भूतग्राममचेतस: ।
मां चैवान्त: शरीरस्थं तान्विद्ध्यासुरनिश्चयान् ॥ ६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4296,\"bb\":3776,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/5-6/b3776/\",\"body_value\":\"aśāstra-vihitaṁ ghoraṁ
tapyante ye tapo janāḥ
dambhāhaṅkāra-saṁyuktāḥ
kāma-rāga-balānvitāḥ\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4297,\"bb\":3777,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/5-6/b3777/\",\"body_value\":\"karṣayantaḥ śarīra-sthaṁ
bhūta-grāmam acetasaḥ
